    "content": {
      "question_html": "<p>Cystic fibrosis is caused by a recessive allele. In one population, 1 in 2500 babies is born with cystic fibrosis.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Use the Hardy–Weinberg equation to estimate the percentage of the population who are carriers.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(4)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">State two assumptions made when using the Hardy–Weinberg equation.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(2)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">q<sup>2</sup> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"frac__n\">1</span><span class=\"frac__d\">2500</span></span> = 0.0004</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">q = 0.02</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">p = 0.98</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">2pq = 0.0392, so about 3.9% are carriers</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Any two: random mating; large population; no selection; no mutation; no migration</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(2)</span></div>",
      "mark_scheme_image_url": null
    }
  },
